# Placement: unit (build configuration of the robot firmware)
# Upstream: firmware/ca/ and firmware/sdkconfig.tailnet.defaults of this tree (MIT); the root is a public certificate
# Check after a build: with the client built in, sdkconfig shows CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CUSTOM_CERTIFICATE_BUNDLE_PATH="ca/travel-roots.pem"; the relay connection log shows no certificate error.
# Kconfig: none (an ESP-IDF option, set only by sdkconfig.tailnet.defaults).
